// Station stronghold pages (/wiki/strongholds/). Pure text builders over the stronghold* tables of
// data/sql/130-strongholds.sql (generated by tools/station-floorplan/generator/export_site.py).
// English pages use only the English columns; Korean pages use the *_ko columns. All values are provisional.

